    Jump over boxes, fences and gaps.

    Falling
    costs 1 life and returns you to the level start.

    Collected fish and remaining
    time are kept after a fall.


    Lose all 3 lives or run out of time: Retry
    the current level.

    Finish all three levels to bring the cat home and win!'
